{
  "version": 1,
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "P5.1",
      "text": "新增只读 InspectAdoption、生成 AdoptPlan、显式 ApplyAdoption；检查当前 ownership、外部不可变身份、配置、依赖、冲突及能力。",
      "gates": [
        "adoption-api",
        "adoption-libvirt",
        "adoption-firecracker"
      ],
      "remaining": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P5.2",
      "text": "认领经过 grant+journal，先保存意图，再写 provider ownership，再验证并提交 state；任意阶段崩溃后能发现本次认领结果。",
      "gates": [
        "adoption-api",
        "real-docker-api",
        "real-libvirt"
      ],
      "remaining": [
        "Complete provider ownership-write/observe/state-commit OS-kill matrix across all providers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P5.3",
      "text": "无 owner 的资源可按计划认领；已有不同 owner 不允许隐式抢占，转移须独立明确授权和旧 owner 退休证明。",
      "gates": [
        "adoption-api",
        "adoption-libvirt"
      ],
      "remaining": [
        "Explicit transfer of resources already owned by a different owner remains unsupported; refusal is implemented."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P5.4",
      "text": "Docker labels 不可原地更新等 provider 限制必须形成可验证的持久绑定模型或显式替换计划，不能伪称已经写入标签。",
      "gates": [
        "real-docker-provider"
      ],
      "remaining": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P5.5",
      "text": "首先恢复 Docker/libvirt 原有可导入能力；Firecracker 不具备可核验启动/进程材料的任意进程不算可认领，给出具体缺失证据，已具备完整 manifest 的资源支持正式接管流程。",
      "gates": [
        "adoption-firecracker",
        "real-docker-provider",
        "real-libvirt",
        "real-firecracker"
      ],
      "remaining": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P5.acceptance",
      "text": "认领后冷恢复、更新、Destroy 全部可用；同名替代对象不能被采用；一半成功时恢复不重复认领、不删除外部原资源。",
      "gates": [
        "real-docker-api",
        "real-docker-provider",
        "real-libvirt",
        "real-firecracker"
      ],
      "remaining": [
        "Full interrupted-adoption recovery acceptance, including control-plane publication windows, is not closed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P6.1",
      "text": "三后端实现一致快照、列表、校验、保留策略、删除；snapshot 覆盖 state+journal 的同一事务视图，不持久化明文 inputs 或凭据。",
      "gates": [
        "snapshot-api",
        "snapshot-storage"
      ],
      "remaining": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P6.2",
      "text": "区分“元数据恢复”和“VM/磁盘快照”。恢复 state 不宣称真实 VM 或文件回到了过去；provider snapshot 若属于原功能需单列矩阵验收。",
      "gates": [
        "snapshot-storage",
        "provider-snapshot-boundary"
      ],
      "remaining": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P6.3",
      "text": "restore 在冻结新受理、撤销当前授权后执行；保留原拓扑身份、提升 metadata revision/epoch，禁止 serial/generation 回退授权，随后强制真实观察与重规划。",
      "gates": [
        "snapshot-api",
        "snapshot-storage"
      ],
      "remaining": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P6.4",
      "text": "snapshot 中带未完成 action 时必须保留为 unresolved，不绕过 journal；不同 lineage 的恢复作为单独导入/灾备流程，不能默认覆盖。",
      "gates": [
        "snapshot-api",
        "snapshot-storage"
      ],
      "remaining": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P6.5",
      "text": "lock/lease inspection 返回实际 owner/epoch/到期/在途情况；force-unlock 变成撤销并等待 gate 停止的审计操作，不 unlink flock 或直接清空 lease。",
      "gates": [
        "authority-api"
      ],
      "remaining": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P6.acceptance",
      "text": "并发快照、restore 崩溃、旧 worker 恢复、错误 lineage、旧 snapshot 与较新资源冲突全部拒绝或进入需观察状态；三后端恢复语义一致。",
      "gates": [
        "snapshot-api",
        "snapshot-storage",
        "authority-api"
      ],
      "remaining": [
        "Full independent-process crash/restore/old-worker matrix is not closed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P8.1",
      "text": "GC 分 Inventory→Candidate→Plan→AuthorizedDelete→Verify；每个候选有 owner/resource/generation、外部 ID、来源、保留期、依赖与引用证据。",
      "gates": [
        "gc-cli",
        "gc-api",
        "gc-host"
      ],
      "remaining": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P8.2",
      "text": "聚合所有 state/journal/task/snapshot/revision/placement 引用，未知、离线、未完整枚举、正在认领/恢复的对象不进入删除计划。",
      "gates": [
        "gc-cli",
        "gc-api",
        "gc-storage",
        "gc-domain-coverage",
        "revision-retention-preview",
        "revision-delete-storage",
        "revision-delete-api",
        "file-registry-retirement",
        "file-revision-gate",
        "file-revision-batch",
        "remote-revision-protocol",
        "remote-revision-api",
        "sql-revision-federation"
      ],
      "remaining": [
        "Explicit file/shared-path/HTTPS consumer pins and SQL downstream retirement are implemented. Final same-source combined federation fault acceptance remains required; unregistered repositories never count as empty."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P8.3",
      "text": "真正删除前重验 epoch、身份、引用和计划版本，走既有 provider Delete+journal，不新增裸路径/名字删除链。",
      "gates": [
        "gc-api",
        "gc-host"
      ],
      "remaining": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P8.4",
      "text": "删除中断可恢复，按依赖逆序，小批量、限制预算；provider inventory 和本地 artifact/cache GC 分清权限范围。",
      "gates": [
        "gc-cli",
        "gc-api",
        "gc-host",
        "real-docker-api",
        "real-libvirt-gc-api",
        "real-firecracker-gc-api",
        "non-docker-gc-process-crash",
        "gc-fenced-disposition-api",
        "gc-fenced-disposition-host",
        "gc-fenced-disposition-storage",
        "firecracker-fenced-cleanup"
      ],
      "remaining": [
        "SQL atomic retention batches and file single-object retirement implemented. Non-Docker missing/corrupt ledger and uncancellable-return/outcome-publication contracts are tested; full provider-internal/API/Agent fault disposition, all-evidence-loss recovery and remote registry federation remain open."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P8.acceptance",
      "text": "dry-run 与执行目标一致；计划后新引用、同名替换、旧 epoch、部分查询失败均不误删；自动清理真实测试孤儿后无受管对象受损。",
      "gates": [
        "gc-cli",
        "gc-api",
        "gc-storage",
        "gc-host",
        "real-docker-api",
        "real-docker-provider",
        "real-libvirt",
        "real-firecracker",
        "real-libvirt-gc-api",
        "real-firecracker-gc-api",
        "non-docker-gc-process-crash"
      ],
      "remaining": [
        "Real Docker/libvirt/Firecracker target deletion and survivor protection, non-Docker batch lost-receipt/cold-API recovery, and process exit before effect/after effect/before report are verified per gate. Full API/Agent SIGKILL and provider-internal fault matrices remain P9.3 work; this requirement is not globally closed by the scoped stage-2 delivery."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P9.1",
      "text": "至少两个独立内核/宿主环境，API 与 Agent 不共享工作目录；KVM/libvirt 场景运行在实际支持这些 provider 的 Agent 上。",
      "gates": [
        "fence-api"
      ],
      "remaining": [
        "Current whole-deployment two-kernel lifecycle evidence is historical; new current-binary no-shared-workdir deployment round is required."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P9.2",
      "text": "Docker/Firecracker/libvirt 分别完成 Apply→Observe→Reset→Exec/File→Cancel→Recover→Destroy→receipt→metadata DELETE，另验收 adoption、snapshot、GC、SSH access。",
      "gates": [
        "real-docker-api",
        "real-docker-provider",
        "real-libvirt",
        "real-firecracker"
      ],
      "remaining": [
        "Full Apply/Observe/Reset/Exec/File/Cancel/Recover/Destroy/receipt/metadata-delete lifecycle per provider/transport is not covered by layer tests."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P9.3",
      "text": "在准入提交、effect 前后、journal提交前后、回报前后逐点 kill API/Agent/helper；增加断网、延迟、重复/乱序消息、磁盘满、DB重启、不可取消调用。",
      "gates": [
        "fence-api",
        "fence-storage",
        "real-docker-api",
        "real-firecracker"
      ],
      "remaining": [
        "All API/Agent/helper crash boundaries, transport faults, disk-full and uncancellable requests are not fully covered."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P9.4",
      "text": "Postgres 双 API 切换和服务故障矩阵；文件/SQLite 验证各自支持的独立进程范围，不把共享文件锁描述成跨宿主仲裁。",
      "gates": [
        "upgrade-api",
        "snapshot-api",
        "gc-api",
        "live-fault-evidence"
      ],
      "remaining": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P9.5",
      "text": "真实更新/重建演练：停止旧 writer、保留证据、精确处置资源、重建不兼容数据、同步 guest/helper/Agent/API；禁止手改version和共享库整体清空。",
      "gates": [
        "upgrade-api",
        "upgrade-aggregate"
      ],
      "remaining": [
        "Real deployment upgrade/rebuild rehearsal preserving old evidence and synchronizing all binaries remains required."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P9.6",
      "text": "整合最新 main、消除能力表与文档矛盾；独立架构/代码审查，测试产物记录 commit、镜像digest、协议/schema、环境与清理结果。",
      "gates": [],
      "remaining": [
        "Latest main integration, final release build/architecture review and same-revision full acceptance remain pending. No merge/push authorization inferred."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P9.acceptance",
      "text": "总验收的缺环境不能以 skip 算通过。发布、推送、合并仍按明确授权进行；实现计划本身不授权删除现有项目或重建用户共享数据库。",
      "gates": [],
      "remaining": [
        "Every uncovered required environment/fault cell must have current evidence; skips are not passes. Publication/merge remains separately scoped."
      ]
    }
  ],
